System/General | LAUNCHER | choice | spotlight,walker | Search launcher (SUPER+SPACE) | none
System/General | SETTINGS_UI | choice | app,rofi | Settings window or rofi menu | none
System/Tools | $SCRIPTS/welcome.sh | action |  | Welcome window (first steps) | none
System/Tools | $SCRIPTS/quickpanel.sh wifi | action |  | Wi-Fi | none
System/Tools | $SCRIPTS/quickpanel.sh bluetooth | action |  | Bluetooth | none
System/Tools | $SCRIPTS/quickpanel.sh sound | action |  | Sound | none
System/Tools | $SCRIPTS/quickpanel.sh battery | action |  | Battery & power mode | none
System/Battery alerts | BATTERY_ALERT_LEVELS | text | 20 10 5;15 5;30 15 5 | Laptop battery alert levels (%) | none
System/Battery alerts | DEVICE_ALERT_LEVEL | number | 5,10,15,20,30 | Mouse / headset alert level (%) | none
System/Tools | $SCRIPTS/quickpanel.sh notifications | action |  | Notifications | none
System/Tools | $SCRIPTS/menus/keybindings.sh | action |  | Keybindings cheat sheet | none
System/Tools | $SCRIPTS/menus/edit-config.sh | action |  | Edit config files | none
System/Tools | hyprctl reload | action |  | Reload Hyprland | none
System/Tools | $SCRIPTS/menus/power.sh | action |  | Power menu | none
